@startuml
title D-06 Post-Restoration Reconciliation Flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor "Operations / Reconciliation" as Ops
participant "ExitPass Continuity" as Continuity
participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Vendor PMS / HCP" as Vendor
participant "Site POS Server" as POS
participant "Dashboard / Reporting" as Dashboard
participant "Operator Console /\nApproved Workflow" as Console

Continuity -> Dashboard : continuity-origin activity list
Ops -> Dashboard : review backlog and exceptions
Dashboard -> Central : payment, tariff, fiscal,\nexit, manual release records
Dashboard -> Vendor : vendor acknowledgment / session status
Dashboard -> POS : fiscal issuance / exception status
Ops -> Console : resolve exception, add notes,\nrequest correction where allowed
Console -> Central : reconciliation outcome
Central -> Continuity : mark reviewed / reconciled

note over Dashboard
Financial review uses canonical payment,
fiscal, and reconciliation records.
Projection is operational visibility only.
end note

@enduml
